[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720[Aegisub Project Garbage]Export Encoding: Unicode (UTF-8)Last Style Storage: Ennies LobbyAudio File: EL21.mkvVideo File: EL21.mkvVideo AR Mode: 4Video AR Value: 1.777778Video Zoom Percent: 0.500000Active Line: 7Video Position: 4609[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,2.5,2,120,120,18,1Style: Captions,Roboto,37,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,2,10,10,20,1Style: Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,28,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,7,10,10,10,1Style: Flashbacks-720p,Impress BT,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.75,2.5,2,120,120,18,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.75,2.5,2,120,120,18,1Style: Lyrics,FOT-Greco Std B,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,2,10,10,15,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,70,&H009E375F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Title,Agency FB,63,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,120,100,0.5,0,1,1.7,0,2,10,10,250,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:58.72,Title,,0,0,0,,Rob LucciDialogue: 1,0:01:53.88,0:01:58.72,Title,,0,0,0,,Rob LucciDialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-They're here! The bombardment has started!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:22.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The buster call has begun!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our targets are Straw Hat Luffy  and his crew of about sixty pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, due to a private  agreement with Admiral Aokiji,Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the criminal Nico Robin—last seen on the Bridge of Hesitation—is not a target.Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.49,0:02:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to assess the current situation!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Completely destroy the Judicial Island, Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All battleships, take your positions!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:03:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat. Our targets are Straw Hat Luffy and his crew of about sixty pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Completely destroy Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... H-Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, you guys! Don't run!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See? The battleships aren't attacking the bridge!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because I'm here!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. My old man said the same thing.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was the only one to avoid the indiscriminate cannon fire!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, the bridge with the criminal Nico Robin is not a target for now.Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look at this! This bridge is safe!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm the chief of CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a crazy sight.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Hey, what's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:09.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop trembling.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry, you guys! Be quick!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop bossing us around, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I may say one more thing, this is aggravating my wounds.Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you carry me a little more gently?Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ask too much!  Besides, you're contradicting yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no exaggeration to say...Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that I paid for the glory of my actions with my entire body!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! All my ribs are broken! All six of them!Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are more than that, so don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you're such a pain!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, would you like to know the secret of my new weapon, Kabuto?Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall explain it to you. Kabuto, Sogeking's weapon, is-Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ta-da! – Shut up, you jerk! Or we'll make you run!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! Spare me! My ribs are broken! A-All ten of them.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– There are more than that. – What?Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then 20... 30?Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about 100?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are more than that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way that's true!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is there water?! What?! Why?! We have no way out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care whether anyone's in the corridor or not.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one can get here now.Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon this room will be underwater.Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This room is above sea level. The water won't reach here.Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can hear the sounds of the battleships' cannon fire, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to your crew? What happened to Nico Robin?Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be worried.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna go rescue them, go right ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you out of my sight.Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what they're going through right now, they'll survive for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if I let you get away now, you'll go kill my friends!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you out of my sight!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bombardment has begun.Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, I can hear a strange sound up ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares?! Hurry up and run!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You make a pretty good boss.Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish an idiot I know could hear you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:31.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I wonder, do you have the ability to back up your decision?Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The result will be the same if you die!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Capture Nico Robin already!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once this is all over, I'll be the world's hero!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The buster call sounds like a gun salute for me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Razor!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick: Leopard Tail!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you really defeat me?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't protect anyone unless I win!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rifle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body: Fruitless Shrub.Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Razor!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:24.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I salute you for having the guts to pick a fight with the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flying Finger Pistol:Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:10:58.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sting!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Triple Sting!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flying Finger Pistol:Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:35.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire Sting!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd met a man with some backbone. How disappointing.Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you did run out of strength from your doping earlier?Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:09.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's backbone you want, I'll show you...Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,another tactic!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear Third!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone Balloon!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone?Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:31.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The power moves from one bone to another.Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a look! My left arm is...Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the arm of a giant!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's all show, don't even bother!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:44.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gigant Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:02.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:25.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm about to pass out. I can't fall into the sea like this!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry and help the injured!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– A beast?! – No, he has an ability!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:09.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I landed on the deck of a battleship. That was close.Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:10.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He flew from the bridge.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he a pirate?Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw a huge hand, too!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop! I said stop!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous up ahead! Water is rushing towards us!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Can't you guys hear the sound of water?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, if the water flows into an underground passage like this,Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll have no choice but to drown.Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:31.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro-kun, can't you hear the sound of water?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I agree that something doesn't feel right.Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's stop already!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no other way. We have to keep going!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water is about to overwhelm Nami and the others!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Pirate guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! Do something about this water!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do something?! What're we supposed to do?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, I told you! This passage is gonna be flooded with water!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Nami-san...Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is rushing into my arms!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How optimistic!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad! We're gonna be trapped in here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't cut it! It's not iron or stone?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an undersea passage.Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be made of some damn thick steel that can bear the water pressure!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then there's nowhere to run!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! It's here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It isn't safe here! We're gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doomed! The sea train won't start!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's the engineer?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here! Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do about capturing  Nico Robin on the Bridge of Hesitation?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Leave her alone. – But...Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as that man is on this island,Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:01.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the mission of escorting Nico Robin,Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we don't have to get involved.Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll just burn down everything but the Bridge of Hesitation.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral,Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is the man you mentioned Rob Lucci of CP9?Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As we suspected, he has a devil fruit ability!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:28.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're asking who you are! Answer us!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand down, you idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put down your guns!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're talking to?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is Rob Lucci of CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:53.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,R-Rob Lucci-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! That's...Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're sorry! Please spare us!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:17:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouths shut. Your whining is grating.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard a lot about Rob Lucci,Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but is he really that good?Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was fifteen years ago...Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In one kingdom,Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:21.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pirates captured some 500 soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In exchange for the hostages' lives, the pirate captain demanded the throne.Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Government sent a boy to the kingdom,Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as it was on the verge of surrender, due to its concern for the hostages.Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:40.16,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A-A child?Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:43.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! That blasted World Government! How insulting!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He infiltrated the pirates' hideout...Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and killed all 500 of the kingdom's soldiers on the spot.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He k-killed all of them?Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That can't be! How could he be forgiven for that?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it's the World Government... Even if it's for justice...Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Pardon me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:39.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,JusticeDialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up. Justice isn't all warm and fuzzy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of you forget it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirates were so enraged that they rained fire upon the boy,Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who was standing on the pile of bodies with his back turned.Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the boy rose from the flames, killed the pirate captain,Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:19:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and single-handedly put the whole affair to rest.Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you kill our valuable hostages?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They committed a crime,Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I executed them in the name of justice.Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A crime?Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soldiers of the kingdom, being weak is a crime.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! Take him down!Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:43.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-How could he have survived that?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:48.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He's a monster!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The boy with several cannonball scars on his back...Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was a CP9 intelligence agent at the age of 13.Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.19,0:20:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some call him the most powerful and ruthless mass killing machine...Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the history of CP9 and its mission of covert justice.Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unreal that he was capable of all that when he was only 13.Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:37.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why all we have to do is carry out our duty.Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocket!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something came out!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Straw Hat Luffy,  whose bounty is 100 million belly!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he'd be that fat.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are! Pigeon guy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That won't work! The Bone Balloon is tough!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Gigant Axe!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Is it a giant?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Gigant Whip!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The masts snapped!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're collapsing!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fight between those two is insane!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol: Sting!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems that as you grow more powerful, you become slower.Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick: Victory Bird!Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He cracked the iron hull!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ship won't last long!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.12,0:22:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close. I almost got split in two.Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you see that, Cutty Flam?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you guys!  Or rather, it was all over from the start!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a bit early to say that when the fight isn't over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.43,0:22:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci is the one fighting Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:22:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the strongest man in the history of CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might've managed to get rid of the others somehow,Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Lucci's another story entirely!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once Straw Hat's taken care of, you're next, Cutty Flam!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:11.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Give me a report.Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, Vice Admiral!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We heard that Straw Hat Luffy and Rob Lucci of CP9 are currently fighting.Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a result, battleship No. 4 is in bad shape!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rob Lucci isn't gonna die.Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All gunners, target battleship No. 4!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare all guns for a volley in five seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Vice Admiral, you must be kidding.Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One thousand of our men are onboard!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A moment's indecision can allow vicious criminals to slip away.Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.07,0:23:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you protect our future from them?Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:08.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:14.84,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:14.89,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:14.89,0:24:14.93,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:14.97,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:15.01,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:15.01,0:24:15.05,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:15.05,0:24:15.10,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:24:15.10,0:24:15.14,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpm